    {
      "date": "2026-11-21T13:02:23",
      "job": "20261121-1239-the-trap-at-salamis",
      "line": 5,
      "speaker": "XERXES",
      "voice": "xerxes",
      "reference_id": "f8dfe9c83081432386f143e2fe9767ef",
      "model": "s2.1-pro-free",
      "bytes": 41,
      "text": "Let them come out. Today the sea is mine.",
      "file": "line_005_xerxes_30d0c12c.mp3",
      "cached": false
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-11-21T13:02:31",
      "job": "20261121-1239-the-trap-at-salamis",
      "line": 6,
      "speaker": "XERXES",
      "voice": "xerxes",
      "reference_id": "f8dfe9c83081432386f143e2fe9767ef",
      "model": "s2.1-pro-free",
      "bytes": 51,
      "text": "Write down every name. I want to remember this day.",
      "file": "line_006_xerxes_6022fc8f.mp3",
      "cached": false
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-11-21T13:02:39",
      "job": "20261121-1239-the-trap-at-salamis",
      "line": 11,
      "speaker": "PYTHIA",
      "voice": "pythia",
      "reference_id": "9b0338d549914b28b652600e511869ab",
      "model": "s2.1-pro-free",
      "bytes": 49,
      "text": "Why sit you there? Flee to the ends of the earth.",
      "file": "line_011_pythia_810bbd41.mp3",
      "cached": false
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-11-21T13:02:47",
      "job": "20261121-1239-the-trap-at-salamis",
      "line": 14,
      "speaker": "PYTHIA",
      "voice": "pythia",
      "reference_id": "9b0338d549914b28b652600e511869ab",
      "model": "s2.1-pro-free",
      "bytes": 39,
      "text": "Only a wall of wood shall not be taken.",
      "file": "line_014_pythia_50e51c54.mp3",
      "cached": false
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-11-21T13:02:55",
      "job": "20261121-1239-the-trap-at-salamis",
      "line": 16,
      "speaker": "PYTHIA",
      "voice": "pythia",
      "reference_id": "9b0338d549914b28b652600e511869ab",
      "model": "s2.1-pro-free",
      "bytes": 55,
      "text": "Divine Salamis, you will destroy the children of women.",
      "file": "line_016_pythia_b87e7135.mp3",
      "cached": false
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-11-21T13:03:02",
      "job": "20261121-1239-the-trap-at-salamis",
      "line": 22,
      "speaker": "THEMISTOCLES",
      "voice": "themistocles",
      "reference_id": "cf270b96152440379e8cb6a42f6c7997",
      "model": "s2.1-pro-free",
      "bytes": 29,
      "text": "The wooden wall is our ships.",
      "file": "line_022_themistocles_4f85b78d.mp3",
      "cached": false
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-11-21T13:03:09",
      "job": "20261121-1239-the-trap-at-salamis",
      "line": 55,
      "speaker": "ADEIMANTUS",
      "voice": "adeimantus",
      "reference_id": "683788ea516848b2ba8f9c2cedbc4b45",
      "model": "s2.1-pro-free",
      "bytes": 49,
      "text": "Be silent. A man without a city has no vote here.",
      "file": "line_055_adeimantus_c9feef42.mp3",
      "cached": false
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-11-21T13:03:16",
      "job": "20261121-1239-the-trap-at-salamis",
      "line": 56,
      "speaker": "THEMISTOCLES",
      "voice": "themistocles",
      "reference_id": "cf270b96152440379e8cb6a42f6c7997",
      "model": "s2.1-pro-free",
      "bytes": 70,
      "text": "While we have two hundred ships, Athens has a city greater than yours.",
      "file": "line_056_themistocles_96380f3c.mp3",
      "cached": false
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-11-21T13:03:23",
      "job": "20261121-1239-the-trap-at-salamis",
      "line": 58,
      "speaker": "THEMISTOCLES",
      "voice": "themistocles",
      "reference_id": "cf270b96152440379e8cb6a42f6c7997",
      "model": "s2.1-pro-free",
      "bytes": 32,
      "text": "Strike, if you will. But listen.",
      "file": "line_058_themistocles_f7d66db6.mp3",
      "cached": false
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-11-21T13:03:32",
      "job": "20261121-1239-the-trap-at-salamis",
      "line": 60,
      "speaker": "THEMISTOCLES",
      "voice": "themistocles",
      "reference_id": "cf270b96152440379e8cb6a42f6c7997",
      "model": "s2.1-pro-free",
      "bytes": 78,
      "text": "Leave, and we take our families and sail to Italy. Fight on without our ships.",
      "file": "line_060_themistocles_527bc67a.mp3",
      "cached": false
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-11-21T13:03:40",
      "job": "20261121-1239-the-trap-at-salamis",
      "line": 66,
      "speaker": "ARTEMISIA",
      "voice": "artemisia",
      "reference_id": "3b61dc6d4dd440309f7454814b77b64b",
      "model": "s2.1-pro-free",
      "bytes": 52,
      "text": "Spare your ships, my king. Do not fight them at sea.",
      "file": "line_066_artemisia_e5851488.mp3",
      "cached": false
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-11-21T13:03:48",
      "job": "20261121-1239-the-trap-at-salamis",
      "line": 70,
      "speaker": "THEMISTOCLES",
      "voice": "themistocles",
      "reference_id": "cf270b96152440379e8cb6a42f6c7997",
      "model": "s2.1-pro-free",
      "bytes": 62,
      "text": "Take a boat. Go to the Persians. Tell them exactly what I say.",
      "file": "line_070_themistocles_f3d83701.mp3",
      "cached": false
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-11-21T13:03:56",
      "job": "20261121-1239-the-trap-at-salamis",
      "line": 72,
      "speaker": "SICINNUS",
      "voice": "sicinnus",
      "reference_id": "212f54ee2f694407bffaa561dc6b5a1c",
      "model": "s2.1-pro-free",
      "bytes": 81,
      "text": "My master is on the king's side. The Greeks are terrified. Tonight they will run.",
      "file": "line_072_sicinnus_33d82beb.mp3",
      "cached": false
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-11-21T13:04:03",
      "job": "20261121-1239-the-trap-at-salamis",
      "line": 73,
      "speaker": "SICINNUS",
      "voice": "sicinnus",
      "reference_id": "212f54ee2f694407bffaa561dc6b5a1c",
      "model": "s2.1-pro-free",
      "bytes": 52,
      "text": "Stop them, and you will watch them fight each other.",
      "file": "line_073_sicinnus_c3f7b260.mp3",
      "cached": false
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-11-21T13:04:12",
      "job": "20261121-1239-the-trap-at-salamis",
      "line": 84,
      "speaker": "ARISTIDES",
      "voice": "aristides",
      "reference_id": "b0a6fbad47a14281b2be0cecee135b08",
      "model": "s2.1-pro-free",
      "bytes": 61,
      "text": "Whatever you decide, it no longer matters. We are surrounded.",
      "file": "line_084_aristides_b189a80b.mp3",
      "cached": false
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-11-21T13:04:20",
      "job": "20261121-1239-the-trap-at-salamis",
      "line": 86,
      "speaker": "THEMISTOCLES",
      "voice": "themistocles",
      "reference_id": "cf270b96152440379e8cb6a42f6c7997",
      "model": "s2.1-pro-free",
      "bytes": 46,
      "text": "Good. That was my message. Now no one can run.",
      "file": "line_086_themistocles_394e9435.mp3",
      "cached": false
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-11-21T13:04:27",
      "job": "20261121-1239-the-trap-at-salamis",
      "line": 88,
      "speaker": "THEMISTOCLES",
      "voice": "themistocles",
      "reference_id": "cf270b96152440379e8cb6a42f6c7997",
      "model": "s2.1-pro-free",
      "bytes": 60,
      "text": "You tell them. From me, they will think it is another trick.",
      "file": "line_088_themistocles_634da343.mp3",
      "cached": false
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-11-21T13:04:36",
      "job": "20261121-1239-the-trap-at-salamis",
      "line": 96,
      "speaker": "THEMISTOCLES",
      "voice": "themistocles",
      "reference_id": "cf270b96152440379e8cb6a42f6c7997",
      "model": "s2.1-pro-free",
      "bytes": 75,
      "text": "Today every man chooses the best in himself, or the worst. Choose the best.",
      "file": "line_096_themistocles_11b70e8c.mp3",
      "cached": false
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-11-21T13:04:43",
      "job": "20261121-1239-the-trap-at-salamis",
      "line": 118,
      "speaker": "XERXES",
      "voice": "xerxes",
      "reference_id": "f8dfe9c83081432386f143e2fe9767ef",
      "model": "s2.1-pro-free",
      "bytes": 43,
      "text": "My men have become women, and my women men.",
      "file": "line_118_xerxes_2da22966.mp3",
      "cached": false
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-11-21T13:04:51",
      "job": "20261121-1239-the-trap-at-salamis",
      "line": 126,
      "speaker": "SICINNUS",
      "voice": "sicinnus",
      "reference_id": "212f54ee2f694407bffaa561dc6b5a1c",
      "model": "s2.1-pro-free",
      "bytes": 81,
      "text": "My master stopped the Greeks from breaking your bridges. He is still your friend.",
      "file": "line_126_sicinnus_dc392e10.mp3",
      "cached": false
    },
