      "text": "Take a boat. Go to the Persians. Tell them exactly what I say.",
      "file": "line_070_themistocles_f3d83701.mp3",
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-11-21T13:38:45",
      "job": "20261121-1239-the-trap-at-salamis",
      "line": 72,
      "speaker": "SICINNUS",
      "voice": "sicinnus",
      "reference_id": "212f54ee2f694407bffaa561dc6b5a1c",
      "model": "s2.1-pro-free",
      "bytes": 81,
      "text": "My master is on the king's side. The Greeks are terrified. Tonight they will run.",
      "file": "line_072_sicinnus_33d82beb.mp3",
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-11-21T13:38:50",
      "job": "20261121-1239-the-trap-at-salamis",
      "line": 73,
      "speaker": "SICINNUS",
      "voice": "sicinnus",
      "reference_id": "212f54ee2f694407bffaa561dc6b5a1c",
      "model": "s2.1-pro-free",
      "bytes": 52,
      "text": "Stop them, and you will watch them fight each other.",
      "file": "line_073_sicinnus_c3f7b260.mp3",
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-11-21T13:38:59",
      "job": "20261121-1239-the-trap-at-salamis",
      "line": 85,
      "speaker": "ARISTIDES",
      "voice": "aristides",
      "reference_id": "b0a6fbad47a14281b2be0cecee135b08",
      "model": "s2.1-pro-free",
      "bytes": 61,
      "text": "Whatever you decide, it no longer matters. We are surrounded.",
      "file": "line_085_aristides_b189a80b.mp3",
      "cached": false
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-11-21T13:39:06",
      "job": "20261121-1239-the-trap-at-salamis",
      "line": 87,
      "speaker": "THEMISTOCLES",
      "voice": "themistocles",
      "reference_id": "cf270b96152440379e8cb6a42f6c7997",
      "model": "s2.1-pro-free",
      "bytes": 46,
      "text": "Good. That was my message. Now no one can run.",
      "file": "line_087_themistocles_394e9435.mp3",
      "cached": false
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-11-21T13:39:14",
      "job": "20261121-1239-the-trap-at-salamis",
      "line": 89,
      "speaker": "THEMISTOCLES",
      "voice": "themistocles",
      "reference_id": "cf270b96152440379e8cb6a42f6c7997",
      "model": "s2.1-pro-free",
      "bytes": 60,
      "text": "You tell them. From me, they will think it is another trick.",
      "file": "line_089_themistocles_634da343.mp3",
      "cached": false
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-11-21T13:39:20",
      "job": "20261121-1239-the-trap-at-salamis",
      "line": 96,
      "speaker": "THEMISTOCLES",
      "voice": "themistocles",
      "reference_id": "cf270b96152440379e8cb6a42f6c7997",
      "model": "s2.1-pro-free",
      "bytes": 75,
      "text": "Today every man chooses the best in himself, or the worst. Choose the best.",
      "file": "line_096_themistocles_11b70e8c.mp3",
      "cached": true
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-11-21T13:39:28",
      "job": "20261121-1239-the-trap-at-salamis",
      "line": 117,
      "speaker": "XERXES",
      "voice": "xerxes",
      "reference_id": "f8dfe9c83081432386f143e2fe9767ef",
      "model": "s2.1-pro-free",
      "bytes": 43,
      "text": "My men have become women, and my women men.",
      "file": "line_117_xerxes_2da22966.mp3",
      "cached": false
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-11-21T13:39:35",
      "job": "20261121-1239-the-trap-at-salamis",
      "line": 118,
      "speaker": "XERXES",
      "voice": "xerxes",
      "reference_id": "f8dfe9c83081432386f143e2fe9767ef",
      "model": "s2.1-pro-free",
      "bytes": 31,
      "text": "Write her name. Write it first.",
      "file": "line_118_xerxes_16d88eb9.mp3",
      "cached": false
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-11-21T13:39:43",
      "job": "20261121-1239-the-trap-at-salamis",
      "line": 129,
      "speaker": "SICINNUS",
      "voice": "sicinnus",
      "reference_id": "212f54ee2f694407bffaa561dc6b5a1c",
      "model": "s2.1-pro-free",
      "bytes": 81,
      "text": "My master stopped the Greeks from breaking your bridges. He is still your friend.",
      "file": "line_129_sicinnus_dc392e10.mp3",
      "cached": false
    }
  ]
}